      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'Styrker''s death led to many changes.  The survivors of his mad crusade
    decided to revoke the monarchy that caused so much trouble and hated.  Though
    the dwarfs kept their ruined powerbase.  The people decided to fend for themselves
    and let individual community handle these problems rather then one big government.


    Luckily
    the rest of the world had their own problems and couldn''t really take advantage
    of this massacure plus their wasn''t much too have anymore.


    The survivors
    re-built and celebrated that the nightmare was over.  And it was all thanks to
    the heros.  You.'
